*> The OPTIONS paragraph of COBOL 2014 follows PROGRAM-ID and holds
*> defaults for the program, such as the rounding mode.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ROUNDS.
OPTIONS.
    DEFAULT ROUNDED MODE IS NEAREST-EVEN
    ENTRY-CONVENTION IS COBOL.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  RESULT              PIC 9(3).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE RESULT ROUNDED = 10 / 4
    DISPLAY RESULT
    STOP RUN.
